[[3,63,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p><a href=\"#/2892063\">7010A04</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2892088\">7010D22</a></p><p>1. Disconnect the linkages on the lock side.</p><p>2. Unscrew the catch retaining bolts.</p><p>3. Move the lock over slightly.</p><p>4. Disconnect the electrical connection then withdraw the lock.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>4</p></td><td><p>Left rear door lock geared motor</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/2890917\">N55</a></p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>4</p></td><td><p>Right rear door lock geared motor</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/2890919\">N56</a></p></td></tr></table></div><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2035606.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[3,63,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Check that the lock is intact\nand undamaged.</p><p>Connect the electrical connection to the\nlock.</p><p>Fit the lock.</p><p>Tighten the bolts.</p><p>Connect the linkages on the lock side.</p><p>Check that the lock works by operating\nthe outer handle.</p><p><a href=\"#/2892088\">7010D22</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2892063\">7010A04</a></p>"]]